<title>SWEDEN: Handelsbanken buys Estonia's Aktoris.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken buys Estonia's Aktoris.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Handelsbanken said on Monday it bought Estonia brokerage and finance company AS Aktoris.</p>
</text>
